From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bcmdhd: port the cfg80211 glue to Linux 7.3

Add 7.3 wrappers for the virtual-interface, station, key,
AP/beacon, mgmt-tx, TDLS and ROC ops, and fix the time,
scan-done, timer, station-info, new/del-sta, disconnected,
band, p2p/btcoex timer, sdio reset and scheduler call sites.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
diff --git a/bcmsdh_sdmmc.c b/bcmsdh_sdmmc.c
index 337c569..dc96111 100755
--- a/bcmsdh_sdmmc.c
+++ b/bcmsdh_sdmmc.c
@@ -59,7 +59,7 @@ static void IRQHandler(struct sdio_func* func);
 static void IRQHandlerF2(struct sdio_func* func);
 #endif /* !defined(OOB_INTR_ONLY) */
 static int sdioh_sdmmc_get_cisaddr(sdioh_info_t* sd, uint32 regaddr);
-#if defined(ENABLE_INSMOD_NO_FW_LOAD) && !defined(BUS_POWER_RESTORE)
+#if defined(ENABLE_INSMOD_NO_FW_LOAD) && !defined(BUS_POWER_RESTORE) && (LINUX_VERSION_CODE < KERNEL_VERSION(7, 3, 0))
 extern int sdio_reset_comm(struct mmc_card* card);
 #else
